<Project>

  <!-- **Deliberately empty, and that is the whole content.** MSBuild walks up from a
       project looking for this file, so without one here every fixture below would be
       handed `clients/dotnet/Directory.Build.props` — a version number, package
       metadata, Source Link. A fixture is a *subject*: what it builds with has to be
       what its own files say, or a test asserting what MSBuild resolved is asserting
       something the harness put there. -->

</Project>
